+ * the kernel VA of the GGTT-pinned fbdev scanout buffer (info->screen_base),
+ * ri_width/ri_height/ri_stride/ri_depth and the RGB field layout come from
+ * the chosen framebuffer (XRGB8888 on CFL). ri_bits is NULL until the first
+ * modeset has run, which is exactly the console-handover trigger. The GMADR
+ * physical base is not recorded in ri (the console draws through the VA), so
+ * fb_paddr is left 0.
+ */
